    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check Out My New Horror Game Color Fear!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Color Fear is on Steam, Wishlist and Play Demo Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/b4ec90300b1faa037d1e0c6aa8a97c59.avif?t=1752110080\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>WONDER WONDEERRR PUUUUUUUUUNCHHHHHH</strong><br>In the unhinged world of Wonder Wonder Punch you will be given a world rank at birth, and to gain a better rank you will have to hunt others and survive being hunted. Candy is an extreme source of power here and anyone with it will kill those without it. Do Bounties, Gain Abilities, Loot Weapons, Hunt and Build to survive the wild world of Wonder Wonder Punch.<br><br>You can also use any items and abilities gained in single player during multiplayer modes. And don't worry you won't lose any items after death so go kill!<br><br><strong>Add To Wishlist Now</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/a65bde91da44b33579ebbbfdd83f14fe.webp?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=15 /></span><br><strong>Explore</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/9b29b29cbc4afb082d905cfcf16a12e7.avif?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=119 /></span><br>Explore the world of Wonder Wonder Punch with hidden mysteries, battles and weapons as far as the eye can see.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/b2eb2fa7aba2634fc6c2325511e3d775.webp?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=15 /></span><br><strong>Build</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/e36540539a5cc53fce3dbe173b5641ec.avif?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=119 /></span><br>Build to your hearts content with tons of assets that match any Wonderers dreams!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/dd0e71f5a0ff93631bee308328236d25.webp?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=15 /></span><br><strong>Upgrades</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/69d7521f878991b1c64a88ad0e9b5079.avif?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=119 /></span><br>Upgrade Character Stats, Weapons and abilities to be the strongest you can be!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/e5dd7fb8868eaeec1d10c3093061a7fa.webp?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=15 /></span><br><strong>Fight In Story Or PVP</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/d92074b85fb3c567c3ef503cb0fffe88.avif?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=119 /></span><br>Fight to your hearts content with special weapons abilities and upgrades you can even go online and use anything you've acquired in special game modes.<br>Also don't worry, you won't lose anything if you die in PVP so no need to stress!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/a65bde91da44b33579ebbbfdd83f14fe.webp?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=15 /></span><br><strong>Customize Your Character</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636370/extras/cf09f503b35c37dbee0f5473233d8fe2.avif?t=1752110080\" width=596 height=119 /></span><br>Make your Wonderer yours and customize your character from head to toe!<br><br><strong>Add To Wishlist Now</strong>",
